  <content>
    <procedure>
      <preliminaryRqmts>
        <reqCondGroup>
          <reqCondNoRef>
            <reqCond>现场要有足够的可操作空间满足泵的拆装；还需备有专门拆装泵的平台。</reqCond>
          </reqCondNoRef>
          <reqCondNoRef>
            <reqCond>现场要具备力矩扳手、千分表、塞尺。</reqCond>
          </reqCondNoRef>
          <reqCondNoRef>
            <reqCond>现场备有零部件及工具等的储存设施。</reqCond>
          </reqCondNoRef>
          <reqCondNoRef>
            <reqCond>现场要有相应的运输工具及起吊行车，包括具备各种安装、操作资质的专业人员。</reqCond>
          </reqCondNoRef>
          <reqCondNoRef>
            <reqCond>现场要具备清洁剂、润滑剂。</reqCond>
          </reqCondNoRef>
        </reqCondGroup>
        <reqSupportEquips>
          <supportEquipDescrGroup>
            <supportEquipDescr>
              <name>手动拉拔器</name>
              <identNumber>
                <manufacturerCode>QB/T5537（规格CSQ-300）</manufacturerCode>
              </identNumber>
              <reqQuantity>1</reqQuantity>
            </supportEquipDescr>
            <supportEquipDescr>
              <name>勾扳手</name>
              <identNumber>
                <manufacturerCode>JB/ZQ4624/(A110-115)</manufacturerCode>
              </identNumber>
              <reqQuantity>1</reqQuantity>
            </supportEquipDescr>
            <supportEquipDescr>
              <name>扳手</name>
              <identNumber>
                <manufacturerCode>M16、M20</manufacturerCode>
              </identNumber>
              <reqQuantity>1</reqQuantity>
            </supportEquipDescr>
          </supportEquipDescrGroup>
        </reqSupportEquips>
        <reqSupplies>
          <noSupplies>
          </noSupplies>
        </reqSupplies>
        <reqSpares>
          <spareDescrGroup>
            <spareDescr>
              <name>机械密封O形圈</name>
              <identNumber>
                <manufacturerCode>见机械密封图纸</manufacturerCode>
              </identNumber>
              <reqQuantity>1</reqQuantity>
            </spareDescr>
          </spareDescrGroup>
        </reqSpares>
        <reqSafety>
          <safetyRqmts>
            <warning>
              <warningAndCautionPara>转子部件动平衡精度不得低于ISO 1940 G2.5级。</warningAndCautionPara>
              <warningAndCautionPara>动平衡试验合格后才能进行后续操作，否则因动平衡不合格而引起的振动大等，最终导致设备的损坏，CQPI将不负责任。</warningAndCautionPara>
              <warningAndCautionPara>动平衡合格后必须将动平衡合格时零件的装配状态（位置、方向等）记录下来，以便复原装配。</warningAndCautionPara>
            </warning>
            <caution>
              <warningAndCautionPara>端面密封面不允许有径向划痕或损伤；径向密封面不允许有轴向划痕或损伤,密封件密封部位不允许任何划痕或凹凸。</warningAndCautionPara>
            </caution>
          </safetyRqmts>
        </reqSafety>
      </preliminaryRqmts>
      <mainProcedure>
        <proceduralStep>
          <title>拆卸</title>
          <para>
            <sequentialList>
              <listItem>
                <para>松开机械密封定位块螺栓，并用定位块固定机械密封，然后紧固定位块螺栓。</para>
              </listItem>
              <listItem>
                <para>卸下轴承体部件与底座之间的支架连接螺栓。</para>
              </listItem>
              <listItem>
                <para>用吊绳系住泵箱体，拆下泵盖与泵体紧固螺柱、螺母及垫圈，使轴承体及转子部件与泵体分离。</para>
              </listItem>
              <listItem>
                <para>将轴承体及转子部件从泵体中抽出，并放置在垫有木板的支架上，运到检修地点。</para>
              </listItem>
              <listItem>
                <para>对泵体进行防异物保护。</para>
              </listItem>
            </sequentialList>
          </para>
        </proceduralStep>
        <proceduralStep>
          <title>检查</title>
          <para>
            <sequentialList>
              <listItem>
                <para>卸下泵侧半联轴器，取下联轴器键。</para>
              </listItem>
              <listItem>
                <para>取下泵盖与泵体之间的O形圈。</para>
              </listItem>
              <listItem>
                <para>测量叶轮密封环与左右壳体密封环配合处径向跳动，要求径向跳动≤0.1mm，将测量结果记入维修报告5.3中。</para>
              </listItem>
              <listItem>
                <para>测量与壳体密封环配合的叶轮密封环外径d1，壳体密封环内径D1，记入维修报告中，计算口环间隙。如果口环间隙、口环内径严重超差，或口环出现严重磨损、变形、腐蚀等缺陷应予以更换。</para>
              </listItem>
              <listItem>
                <para>卸下叶轮螺母、止动垫圈。</para>
              </listItem>
              <listItem>
                <para>拔出叶轮、取下叶轮键。</para>
              </listItem>
              <listItem>
                <para>拆除泵盖和托架之间连接螺栓。</para>
              </listItem>
              <listItem>
                <para>拆除机械密封压盖和泵盖之间联接螺母及垫片。</para>
              </listItem>
              <listItem>
                <para>拆除泵盖。</para>
              </listItem>
              <listItem>
                <para>测量与壳体密封环配合的叶轮口环外径d2，壳体密封环内径 D2，记入维修报告5.3中，计算口环间隙。如果口环间隙、口环内径严重超差，或口环出现严重磨损、变形、腐蚀等缺陷应予以更换。</para>
              </listItem>
              <listItem>
                <para>抽出机械密封，拆除螺柱、螺母、垫圈，取下托架。</para>
              </listItem>
              <listItem>
                <para>拆下非驱动端轴承隔离器和轴承压盖螺栓及垫圈，取出轴承压盖和O形圈。</para>
              </listItem>
              <listItem>
                <para>同样的操作步骤拆卸驱动端轴承隔离器、轴承压盖、O形圈及调整垫。</para>
              </listItem>
              <listItem>
                <para>利用轴承拉拔器对非驱动端轴承外圈及滚珠进行拆卸。</para>
              </listItem>
              <listItem>
                <para>将转子部件从驱动端抽出，并放置检修区域，随后取出甩油环。</para>
              </listItem>
              <listItem>
                <para>拆卸非驱动端轴承内圈。</para>
              </listItem>
              <listItem>
                <para>拆卸驱动端滚动轴承圆螺母及垫圈。</para>
              </listItem>
              <listItem>
                <para>利用轴承拉拔器对驱动端滚动轴承进行拆卸。</para>
              </listItem>
            </sequentialList>
          </para>
        </proceduralStep>
        <table>
          <title>
          </title>
          <tgroup cols="4">
            <colspec colname="c0" colwidth="76*">
            </colspec>
            <colspec colname="c1" colwidth="76*">
            </colspec>
            <colspec colname="c2" colwidth="76*">
            </colspec>
            <colspec colname="c3" colwidth="76*">
            </colspec>
            <thead>
              <row>
                <entry align="center" colname="c0" valign="middle">
                  <para>测试部位</para>
                </entry>
                <entry align="center" colname="c1" valign="middle">
                  <para>设计值（mm）</para>
                </entry>
                <entry align="center" colname="c2" valign="middle">
                  <para>允许间隙（mm）</para>
                </entry>
                <entry align="center" colname="c3" valign="middle">
                  <para>备注</para>
                </entry>
              </row>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <row>
                <entry align="center" colname="c0" valign="middle">
                  <para>机械密封止口与泵盖</para>
                </entry>
                <entry align="center" colname="c1" valign="middle">
                  <para>Φ140H7/f7</para>
                </entry>
                <entry align="center" colname="c2" valign="middle">
                  <para>+0.043~+0.123</para>
                </entry>
                <entry align="center" colname="c3" valign="middle">
                  <para>间隙配合</para>
                </entry>
              </row>
            </tbody>
          </tgroup>
        </table>
      </mainProcedure>
      <closeRqmts>
        <reqCondGroup>
          <noConds>
          </noConds>
        </reqCondGroup>
      </closeRqmts>
    </procedure>
  </content>
